{"title":"Career Roadmap · Contracts Specialist","role":"Contracts Specialist","summary":"A Contracts Specialist manages the legal and commercial lifecycle of business contracts. The role sits at the intersection of law, business, negotiation, risk management, procurement and operations.","facts":{"Current degree":"Law - LLB / BA LLB / BBA LLB / B.Com LLB / B.Sc LLB (Integrated)","Course":"Business Law (BBA LLB / B.Com LLB)"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Contracts Specialist manages the legal and commercial lifecycle of business contracts. The role sits at the intersection of law, business, negotiation, risk management, procurement and operations."},{"type":"p","text":"A Contracts Specialist may work on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Vendor agreements"},{"text":"Customer contracts"},{"text":"Service agreements"},{"text":"Employment-related agreements"},{"text":"Non-disclosure agreements"},{"text":"Licensing agreements"},{"text":"Partnership agreements"},{"text":"Purchase agreements"},{"text":"Statements of Work"},{"text":"Master Service Agreements"},{"text":"Software and technology agreements"},{"text":"Lease and facility agreements"},{"text":"Procurement contracts"},{"text":"Commercial agreements"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The professional typically helps the organization draft, review, negotiate, execute, monitor and renew contracts, while ensuring that contractual obligations and risks are properly managed."}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Class 12","LLB / BA LLB / BBA LLB / B.Com LLB","Business / Corporate / Contract Law","Contract Drafting & Review Skills","Legal / Contracts Internship","Contract Analyst / Legal Executive","Contracts Specialist","Senior Contracts Specialist","Contracts Manager","Head – Contracts / Commercial Legal","Legal Operations / General Counsel Track"]},{"type":"p","text":"Alternative route:"},