"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Contract cycle time"},{"text":"Negotiation duration"},{"text":"Contract value"},{"text":"Risk patterns"},{"text":"Renewal rates"},{"text":"Supplier performance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Legal Automation"},{"type":"p","text":"Routine tasks increasingly include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Template generation"},{"text":"Clause comparison"},{"text":"Metadata extraction"},{"text":"Renewal alerts"},{"text":"Obligation tracking"},{"text":"This increases the value of professionals who understand both contracts and technology."}]}]},{"heading":"Target Profile at Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should ideally be able to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Understand commercial contract principles"},{"text":"Review business agreements"},{"text":"Draft basic commercial contracts"},{"text":"Identify contractual risks"},{"text":"Explain major contract clauses"},{"text":"Conduct contract redlining"},{"text":"Understand negotiation strategy"},{"text":"Understand procurement workflows"},{"text":"Understand technology contracts"},{"text":"Track contractual obligations"},{"text":"Build contract databases"},{"text":"Use Excel effectively"},{"text":"Build basic Power BI dashboards"},{"text":"Understand CLM systems"},{"text":"Use AI responsibly for contract analysis"},{"text":"Communicate legal risks in business language"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Ideal Portfolio"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"10+ Contract Drafting Exercises"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"10+ Contract Review / Redlining Exercises"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Contract Clause Library"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Contract Risk Matrix"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Contract Lifecycle Dashboard"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"SaaS Contract Case Study"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Commercial Negotiation Simulation"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"2–3 Relevant Internships"}]}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CONTRACT LAW"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"COMMERCIAL LAW"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"CONTRACT DRAFTING"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"CONTRACT REVIEW"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"LEGAL RISK ANALYSIS"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"COMMERCIAL NEGOTIATION"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"PROCUREMENT KNOWLEDGE"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"TECHNOLOGY CONTRACTS"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"CONTRACT LIFECYCLE MANAGEMENT"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"EXCEL + POWER BI"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"LEGAL OPERATIONS"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"AI CONTRACT ANALYSIS"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"BUSINESS COMMUNICATION"}]}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest positioning for this career is:"},{"type":"p","text":"“Commercial contracts professional combining legal expertise, contract drafting and review, negotiation, risk management, business understanding and contract technology.”"},{"type":"p","text":"The student should aim to become more than someone who simply reads contracts."},{"type":"p","text":"The ideal capability is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business Requirement","Contract","Legal Risk","Commercial Negotiation","Approval","Execution","Obligation Management","Renewal"]},{"type":"h","text":"Career-Fitment Mapping Note"},{"type":"p","text":"Contracts Specialist is a strong business-law career because it combines the student's legal education with commercial decision-making. The most valuable differentiator is the ability to understand why a business needs a contract, what risks the clauses create, how those risks can be negotiated, and how the agreement should be managed after signing. For technology-focused students, adding SaaS, data protection, cybersecurity, IP and CLM knowledge can create a particularly strong modern specialization."}]}]}